                     <property name="toolTip">
                      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rotate the Orbit trap shape around the selected axis (degrees).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Effects by shape: - Line: sets the line direction. - Circle: sets the ring’s axis. - Square: sets the plane/orientation. - Cube: sets the cube orientation. - Sphere: usually no visible effect. - Point: no effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notes: - Angles are in degrees; internal order is Z → Y → X. - Rotation is applied around the Orbit trap center (see “Relative center”).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                     </property>
